# An ssh Host alias (or target) of a machine that has herdr-core (hc) installed, for the
# live test's remote leg, for example: buildbox. Not a herdr 0.9 profile id. The test adds it
# to its sandbox core as a temporary machine on the remote session herdr-ui-qa. Leave empty to skip.
HERDR_UI_TEST_MACHINE=
HERDR_UI_LIVE=0
# Comma-separated extra patterns (your real machine names, hosts, paths) that
# scripts/check-no-personal-data.sh must never find in the repo.
HERDR_UI_PRIVATE_PATTERNS=
